      "text": "MEET THE NEW MISS EARTH QUEENS! 👑\n\nNatálie Puškinová of the Czech Republic won the Miss Earth 2025 crown during the coronation night held in Manila on Wednesday. \n\nJoining her in the winners’ circle were Miss Earth Air 2025 Sóldís Vala Ívarsdóttir of Iceland, Miss Earth Water 2025 Mỹ Anh Trịnh of Vietnam, and Miss Earth Fire 2025 Waree Ngamkham of Thailand. (Photos by Ryan Baldemor/The Philippine STAR)",
